---
title: Convrtrs
customPermalink: /convrtrs/
tags: tools
summary: >-
    Converts text to and from binary, hex, Base64, decimal, Morse and more, in every format at once.
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% from "macros/delimiter.njk" import delimiter %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{% set intro %}
    <p>The info button at the top right of each box describes its format and links to more information. You can also copy any box, or download it as a text file. Turn on Live typing to convert as you type, without pressing a button.</p>
    <p>With Chain decoders on, each Decode button sends its result to the Text box. This is useful when text has been through several encoding steps, such as <code class="tool-example">Text</code> &srarr; <code class="tool-example">Binary</code> &srarr; <code class="tool-example">Base64</code> &srarr; <code class="tool-example">Reverse</code> &srarr; <code class="tool-example">Hexadecimal</code>, so you can quickly decode your puzzle a step at a time, without copying and pasting between boxes.</p>
{% endset %}
{% call toolSection(intro) %}
<div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 column-gap-4 mb-3">
    <div class="form-check form-switch">
        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="liveTyping">
        <label class="form-check-label" for="liveTyping">Live typing</label>
    </div>
    <div class="form-check form-switch">
        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="chainDecoders">
        <label class="form-check-label" for="chainDecoders">Chain decoders</label>
    </div>
</div>
{#- One announcement per conversion, rather than one per box, for screen readers #}
<p class="visually-hidden" aria-live="polite" id="convrtrsAnnounce"></p>
<div class="grid g-3">
    {% for tool in convrtrs %}
    {% if convrtrs.length %}
    <div class="g-col-12 g-col-md-6 g-col-lg-4 g-col-hd-3 g-col-hd-3 g-col-fhd-3">
        {#- Cards fill their row, and each box grows into the spare height, so a two-line status in one card keeps the
            buttons level across the row #}
        <div class="card shadow-sm h-100" id="{{ filename }}-{{ tool.id }}">
            <div class="card-body d-flex flex-column">
                {#- The format's name and a one-line hint, then any setting and the info button, each at least 44px square.
                    Info opens in a popover (components/_info-popover.scss) that stays open until it's dismissed. #}
                <div class="convrtr-head">
                    <div class="convrtr-head__titles">
                        <label class="card-label" for="form-{{ tool.id }}">{{ tool.cardLabel }}</label>
                        <span class="convrtr-head__hint" id="{{ filename }}-{{ tool.id }}-hint">{{ tool.hint }}</span>
                    </div>
                    {% if tool.id == "hex" %}
                    <label class="visually-hidden" for="{{ filename }}Delimiter">Hex delimiter</label>
                    {{ delimiter(filename) }}
                    {% endif %}
                    {% if tool.id == "morsenary" %}
                    <label class="visually-hidden" for="morsenarySetting">Morsenary digits</label>
                    <select id="morsenarySetting" class="form-select" autocomplete="off">
                        <option value="default" selected="">. = 0</option>
                        <option value="flipped">- = 0</option>
                    </select>
                    {% endif %}
                    <button type="button" class="convrtr-head__info" popovertarget="{{ filename }}-{{ tool.id }}-info"
                        aria-label="About {{ tool.cardLabel }}" title="About {{ tool.cardLabel }}">
                        <i class="bi bi-info-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    </button>
                    <div class="info-popover" id="{{ filename }}-{{ tool.id }}-info" popover role="note">
                        <strong>{{ tool.cardLabel }}</strong>
                        <p>{{ tool.popoverContent }}</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <textarea placeholder="{{ tool.placeholder }}" rows="5" id="form-{{ tool.id }}" class="form-control flex-grow-1 data-to-copy active" autocomplete="off"
                    aria-describedby="{{ filename }}-{{ tool.id }}-hint {{ filename }}-{{ tool.id }}-status"></textarea>
                {#- Where the box's text came from (or what's wrong with it), and its length #}
                <div class="convrtr-status">
                    <span id="{{ filename }}-{{ tool.id }}-status"></span>
                    <span data-count>0 characters</span>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mt-2">
                    {% if loop.first == true %}
                    <span data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="{{ tool.buttonLabel }}">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-md btn-convrtr" id="{{ tool.buttonId }}" aria-label="{{ tool.buttonLabel }}">Encode</button>
                    </span>
                    {% else %}
                    <span data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="{{ tool.buttonLabel }}">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-md btn-light" id="{{ tool.buttonId }}" aria-label="{{ tool.buttonLabel }}">
                            Decode
                        </button>
                    </span>
                    {% endif %}
                    <div class="btn-group">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-md btn-light btn-select" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" aria-label="Select All" data-bs-original-title="Select All"><i class="bi bi-check2-square"></i></button>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-md btn-light btn-copy" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" aria-label="Copy to clipboard" data-bs-original-title="Copy to clipboard"><i class="bi bi-clipboard"></i></button>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-md btn-light btn-download" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" aria-label="Download" data-bs-original-title="Download"><i class="bi bi-download"></i></button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
</div>
{% endcall %}
